DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20261105T090000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Kolkata:20261105T133000
SUMMARY:[Fintech D01] Double-Entry Ledger\, Paise Math & ISO 8583 Core (Project 1: UPI Switch)
DESCRIPTION:PROJECT: Project 1: UPI Switch (Day 1 of 30)\n\n1. DEEP THEORY & INDUSTRY STUDY (09:00 - 10:30):\nStudy: Why floats fail in money\; integer paise (Rule 1)\; append-only double-entry debit/credit postings summing to 0 (Rules 2-3)\; derived available balances excluding holds\; ISO 8583 message fields (MTI 0200/0210/0420/0430/0100/0110\, STAN\, RRN\, Response Codes) & reference chains (Rule 4).\n\n2. CORE BACKEND & INFRA BUILD (10:30 - 13:30):\nBuild: Scaffold shared core library across all 4 projects: HMAC-SHA256 service-to-service signing with 5-min timestamp replay protection (Rule 9)\, strict Idempotency Key middleware returning 409 on payload mismatch (Rule 5)\, immutable Audit Log table (Rule 8)\, and ISO 8583 JSON message validator.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Starting in 15m: [Fintech D01] Double-Entry Ledger\, Paise Math & ISO 8583 Core (Project 1: UPI Switch)
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
