SUMMARY:[Fintech D03] Switch 6-Hop Pay Flow & Exactly-Once RRN Debit (Project 1: UPI Switch)
DESCRIPTION:PROJECT: Project 1: UPI Switch (Day 3 of 30)\n\n1. DEEP THEORY & INDUSTRY STUDY (09:00 - 10:30):\nStudy: The 6-hop pay lifecycle (Client -> Payer PSP -> Switch -> Remitter Bank -> Switch -> Beneficiary Bank -> Payer PSP -> Client)\, database row locking\, and unique RRN constraints for exactly-once debit.\n\n2. CORE BACKEND & INFRA BUILD (10:30 - 13:30):\nBuild: Central Switch POST /pay (MTI 0200/0210) & Balance Enquiry (MTI 0100/0110). Enforce strict state machine transitions (Rule 6). Write the 5-concurrent duplicate submission test proving 1 RRN = 1 debit + 1 credit.
