SUMMARY:[Fintech D04] Timeouts\, Status Checks (CHK)\, 0420 Reversals & Deemed-Approved (Project 1: UPI Switch)
DESCRIPTION:PROJECT: Project 1: UPI Switch (Day 4 of 30)\n\n1. DEEP THEORY & INDUSTRY STUDY (09:00 - 10:30):\nStudy: Rule 7 (A timeout is an unknown outcome\, never an immediate failure)\, status check polling (CHK)\, credit-leg retry schedules\, MTI 0420 reversals\, and deemed-approved conflicts (late 0210 00 after timeout/reversal).\n\n2. CORE BACKEND & INFRA BUILD (10:30 - 13:30):\nBuild: Configurable 5s bank timeout + CHK probe\; DEBIT_SUCCESS_CREDIT_PENDING retry worker (Redis Streams/Kafka)\; MTI 0420 auto-reversal on credit deadline expiry\; deemed-approved exception flagging\; mid-transaction crash recovery on Switch startup.
