SUMMARY:[Fintech D10] Smart Acquirer Routing\, Rolling Health Scores & Technical Failover (Project 2: Payment Gateway)
DESCRIPTION:PROJECT: Project 2: Payment Gateway (Day 10 of 30)\n\n1. DEEP THEORY & INDUSTRY STUDY (09:00 - 10:30):\nStudy: Juspay-style orchestration: BIN routing (first 6 digits)\, amount bands\, rolling 1-min health score (success rate\, p95 latency\, timeouts)\, and retrying ONCE on technical failure (5xx/timeout) vs NEVER retrying business declines (51 insufficient funds / wrong OTP).\n\n2. CORE BACKEND & INFRA BUILD (10:30 - 13:30):\nBuild: Routing Engine & per-minute health score calculator\; automatic acquirer demotion/restoration\; within-session failover on technical failure\; operator force/block overrides with audit logs\; attempt-by-attempt routing reason recording.
